{"version":1,"content":"<p>應屆港姐季軍李澤欣與2024年港姐亞軍梁嘉莹，昨日分別在社交網分享慶生照，李澤欣身穿黑色吊帶裙在充滿情調的餐廳慶祝，並對着蛋糕許願，不少網民猜測她與男友撐枱腳，共度浪漫一夜。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T20:56:26.655900+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T20:01:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T20:49:42.327899+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T20:49:42.327899+00:00","content_hash":"ce33b678e4491ab4d9fb1b692192c5ef7d3738617d256171f8ac8a9adb67f838","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}